 "description": "<p>Flapping is the third sensation most rose toys leave out. This one adds it: a soft pad inside the rose head that beats against the clitoris in quick taps, layered under ten combined vibration, sucking and flapping patterns. Where suction pulls and vibration hums, the flap delivers the percussive tap — three distinct feelings cycling from one flower-shaped head.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_1_87358449-f886-4142-bd40-5983dd16480c_480x480.jpg?v=1689575507\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p>The listing calls the material ultra-premium silicone over ABS, which in practice means a silky, non-sticky surface that does not collect lint. The functions cover clit, nipple and G-spot work, so the same toy handles warm-up and main event without a swap.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_3_78ef7ae4-54ce-41cb-9b9b-7e2f5175564e_480x480.jpg?v=1689575511\"></p>\n<p>Battery economics are printed plainly: three hours on the magnetic USB cable buys 0.8 to 1.5 hours of play, and the motor stays under 50 dB while running — quiet enough for thin walls.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_5_effbc49a-bec4-42a3-809e-eadf539dea31_480x480.jpg?v=1689575514\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Functions: vibrating, sucking and flapping in 10 patterns</li>\n<li>Targets: clitoris, nipples, G-spot</li>\n<li>Material: ultra-premium silicone + ABS</li>\n<li>Charging: USB magnetic, 3 hours full</li>\n<li>Working time: 0.8–1.5 hours</li>\n<li>Noise: under 50 dB; waterproof IPX6</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_6_bba9e2cc-e17f-4b23-ab26-526a44736325_480x480.jpg?v=1689575517\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator pink\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpink_7_d143aa0e-24c9-4956-a794-f6799b18e5e0_480x480.jpg?v=1689575520\"></p>\n<p>For anyone whose current rose toy does two of the three jobs, this is the missing third.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Rose suction vibrator adding a flapping pad to 10 combined patterns, silicone body, 3 h charge for up to 1.5 h play, under 50 dB.</p>\n",
